    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### CLZ — Round-Robin cal.com → Google Calendar\n\n**Flujo (v1):**\n1. `Webhook` recibe POST de cal.com (BOOKING_CREATED / RESCHEDULED / CANCELLED).\n2. `Parse Payload` normaliza el JSON a campos top-level.\n3. `Switch by triggerEvent` ramifica a 3 lanes + fallback.\n\n**Lane CREATED (y=0):**\n- `Get routing` lee `clz_event_type_routing` → `Switch by routing`.\n  - **matias** → insert + Respond.\n  - **fabian** → entra al MOVE flow directo.\n  - **round-robin** → `Asignar RR atómico` → IF assigned_to=fabian → MOVE flow / else insert matias + Respond.\n- MOVE flow: `Insert assignment (fabian)` → `Wait 5s` → `GCal Matias getAll` → IF found → delete + create / direct create → `Update mapping` → Respond.\n\n**Lane RESCHEDULED (y=700):**\n- Lookup por `uid` o `rescheduleUid` → IF estaba en Fabián → update event en Fabián + Update DB / else no-op.\n\n**Lane CANCELLED (y=1100):**\n- Lookup por uid → IF estaba en Fabián → delete event Fabián + Update DB / else solo Update DB.\n\n**Antes de activar:** reemplazar `MATIAS_CALENDAR_ID_REPLACE` y `FABIAN_CALENDAR_ID_REPLACE` con los Calendar IDs reales. Crear credenciales `Google Calendar | Collazo Matías` y `Google Calendar | Collazo Fabián` y rebindear en cada nodo GCal. Ejecutar `clz-round-robin-schema.sql` en Postgres Collazo. Configurar webhook en cal.com Settings → Developer → Webhooks.\n\nVer `06_docs/round-robin-design.md` y `06_docs/calcom-webhook-setup.md`.",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 540
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-1200, -240],
      "id": "50000000-5000-4000-8000-500000000001",
      "name": "Sticky Note — README"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚠️ PLACEHOLDERS A REEMPLAZAR\n\n- `MATIAS_CALENDAR_ID_REPLACE` → calendar ID de Matías\n- `FABIAN_CALENDAR_ID_REPLACE` → calendar ID de Fabián\n- credenciales `REPLACE_ME_MATIAS` y `REPLACE_ME_FABIAN` → vincular OAuth tokens reales en n8n UI\n\nFormato calendar ID:\n- `email@gmail.com` (primary)\n- `c_abcdef@group.calendar.google.com` (secondary)",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 380
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
